  "heading": "Practising advocate not to sit as Magistrate in certain Courts.",
  "chapter": null,
  "order": 526,
  "text": "No advocate who practices in the Court of any Magistrate shall sit as a Magistrate in that Court or in any Court within the local jurisdiction of that Court.",
